<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><b>Item&#160;5.07. Submission of Matters to a Vote of Security Holders.</b></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-indent: 20.4pt">On May 28, 2025, Passage Bio, Inc. (the &#8220;<b><i>Company</i></b>&#8221;)
held its 2025 Annual Meeting of Stockholders (the &#8220;<b><i>Annual Meeting</i></b>&#8221;) and the following proposals were adopted:</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&#160;</p>

<table cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse">
