    <td style="white-space: nowrap; width: 23px; padding-top: 4pt; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</td>
    <td style="text-align: left; white-space: nowrap; width: 23px; font-size: 10pt; vertical-align: top">1.</td>
    <td style="font-size: 10pt; text-align: justify">Election of two Class II directors, identified in the table below, each to serve a three-year term, which will expire at the 2028 Annual Meeting of Stockholders and until such time as their respective successors have been duly elected and qualified or until their earlier resignation or removal:</td></tr>
  </table>
<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 54.75pt">&#160;</p>

