    <td style="white-space: nowrap; width: 25px; padding-top: 8pt; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</td>
    <td style="white-space: nowrap; width: 25px; font-size: 10pt">3.</td>
    <td>Approval for the Company&#8217;s Board of Directors (the &#8220;<b><i>Board</i></b>&#8221;) to implement, at the Board's discretion,
    &#160;an amendment to the Company&#8217;s Restated Certificate of Incorporation to effect a reverse stock split of its outstanding
    shares of common stock at a ratio of any whole number between 1-for-5 and 1-for-50, with the exact ratio to be determined by the
    Board, prior to December 31, 2025, subject to the Board&#8217;s authority to abandon such amendment (without further action by the
    Company&#8217;s stockholders): &#160;</td></tr>
  </table>



